=== Text #1 ===
> [The] Professional Regulation Commission (PRC) officially announced on Friday, October 16 the complete list of passers for October 2015 Certified Public Accountant (CPA) board exam. Ralley[ Sor]iano[ Par]agas of Colegio de Dagupan (for. Computronix College) topped the board with 92.86 percent grade.
Ian Kier Javate Valencia of[ Bat]angas State University (BatSU) placed second with 92.57 percent rating.
Polytechnic University of[ the] Philippines (PUP) -[ Sta.] Mesa,[ Holy] Angel University (HAU), Ateneo de Davao (ADU[)] and[ University] of Baguio (UB) graduates complete the upper 5 slots.[]

