> [The] PUMA x OUTLAW MOSCOW Court Platform Sneakers bring[ the] classic silhouette to a[ whole] new level with bold АУТЛО influences. The iconic court shape with a smooth tonal suede upper features added military detailing and a thick, bold rubber sole with large embossed brick texture around the midsole. A woven label at[ the] outer heel and Russian Cyrillic wording adds a striking touch that makes these sneakers[ perfectly] streetwear-ready.[]

