=== Text #1 ===
> [The] Alternate Realities VR Award celebrates virtual reality documentary as a flourishing creative genre awarding the project that displays excellence in factual storytelling as[ well] as technical ingenuity.
Notes on Blindness has won the British Independent Film Award for Best Documentary of 2016. The BIFAs highlight and reward the best,[ most] innovative[ and] creative independent filmmaking and filmmakers in the UK.[]

